From 53f4bf70babc578835f529a322c1f5d101e229bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: marulimo <73472959+marulimo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:21:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] fix(llms): advance Bedrock prompt-cache checkpoints
 through tool-result continuations

Fork patch 0003 carries upstream cline/cline#14481 (commits 964e2353c,
afb402e98, 5fa67cec1, head 5fa67cec by marulimo), source half:

- applyBedrockCachePointToLastCacheableMessage puts the Converse cachePoint
  marker on the last user message, or on the last tool-result message during a
  tool continuation, so the cached prefix advances with the tool loop.
- With no tools active, Bedrock drops tool history, so the marker stays on the
  last user message.
- usePromptCache === false turns Bedrock cache points off.

Drop this patch when #14481 merges upstream.
